WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.125
Zero entropy, no smooth model.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.521
Infinite entropy was the only known obstacle. This

3
00:00:05.521 --> 00:00:08.342
system has zero entropy, yet no smooth model.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.990
A test every smooth model passes, in

5
00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.781
any disguise; this system fails it.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.524
Claimed: a counterexample, on every compact manifold.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.099
Lean covers part.
